思路：分块。这篇博客说得很不错。http://www.cnblogs.com/sweetsc/archive/2012/08/15/2639395.html&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>codeforces #319 div 2 E C. Points on Plane (分块)</title><link>https://111qqz.com/2015/09codeforces319div2ec-pointsonplane/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2015 14:16:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/2015/09codeforces319div2ec-pointsonplane/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;初识分快.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;引一段题解：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s split rectangle 106 × 106 by vertical lines into 1000 rectangles 103 × 106. Let&amp;rsquo;s number them from left to right. We&amp;rsquo;re going to pass through points rectangle by rectangle. Inside the rectangle we&amp;rsquo;re going to pass the points in increasing order of &lt;em&gt;y&lt;/em&gt;-coordinate if the number of rectangle is even and in decreasing if it&amp;rsquo;s odd.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>